      "source_label": "Source at e62c0d720aa9",
      "catalog_url": null,
      "native_url": null,
      "excerpt": "ThermoWeave is a synthetic electrothermal demonstrator. Reproduction means regenerating the same declared scenario, result contract, metrics, and manifests; it does not establish real-cell accuracy, safety, lifetime, or certification.",
