      "catalog_url": null,
      "native_url": null,
      "excerpt": "Adaptive spatial electrothermal digital twin for exploring scalar, vectorized, zonal, and coolant-propagation battery boundaries in MATLAB. The portable graph core includes bounded adaptive cooling, seeded fault/variability studies, 31 local tests, and a traceable animated case study.",
