      "source_kind": "audited-native-source",
      "source_label": "Source at e62c0d720aa9",
      "catalog_url": null,
      "native_url": null,
      "excerpt": "ThermoWeave separates implementation consistency from real-cell validation. The current evidence demonstrates behavior of the independently authored synthetic model; it does not establish predictive accuracy for a physical battery.",
